      "writtenOn": "2025-12-16T17:29:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this color advancing loop, just break here (no AND condition). The original break works for both the instant transition and the termination scenarios. The termination should be handled in the next tick. For example, in the line 188.\n```\n\tif ((GET_DURATION(patterns[i], patterns[i].cur_color) \u003d\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026\n\t    patterns[i].cur_color \u003d\u003d patterns[i].pattern_len - 1)\n\t\tcontinue;\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 212,
        "startChar": 8,
